{"id": "DfXg2NXxigs", "title": "Video by therishikatha", "description": "Why did Vishnu appear as a FISH? A turtle? Half a lion? Every one of his 10 avatars was the exact answer to a problem 🐟🐢🐗🦁 And the 10th is yet to arrive.\n\n1️⃣ MATSYA: a tiny fish begged King Manu to save it. Then it grew huge and towed his boat through the great flood.\n2️⃣ KURMA: while the gods and asuras churned the ocean, the mountain began to sink. Vishnu became a turtle and held it up on his back.\n3️⃣ VARAHA: a demon sank the earth in the cosmic ocean. Vishnu dived as a boar and lifted her out on his tusks.\n4️⃣ NARASIMHA: Hiranyakashipu's boon said no man, no beast, not by day, not by night, not inside, not outside. So Vishnu appeared half-man, half-lion, at dusk, on the doorstep.\n5️⃣ VAMANA: King Bali ruled all three worlds. A little boy asked him for just 3 steps of land. Two steps covered everything, and Bali offered his own head for the third.\n6️⃣ PARSHURAMA: when kings grew arrogant and cruel, he arrived with the axe Shiva gave him.\n7️⃣ RAM: Ravana's boon protected him from gods and demons, but he never bothered about humans. So Vishnu was born a man.\n8️⃣ KRISHNA: he told us why he keeps arriving: \"Whenever dharma declines… I appear, age after age\" (Bhagavad Gita 4.7–8).\n9️⃣ BUDDHA: he spoke against animal sacrifice, out of compassion.\n🔟 KALKI: at the end of Kali Yuga, he will arrive on a white horse.\n\n📖 Sources: Agni Purana ch. 2–16 (the ten in order), Bhagavata Purana (8.24, 8.7, 3.13, 7.3–7.8, 8.18–22, 12.2), Valmiki Ramayana Bala Kanda 16, Bhagavad Gita 4.7–8, Jayadeva's Gita Govinda.\n\n📚 Stories of Shakti for little ones: the Navadurga Set from Rishi Katha is out now. Check the link in bio (rishikatha.com).\n\n💬 Which avatar is YOUR favourite? Comment the name 👇\n🔁 Save this and share it with someone who can name all 10.\n\n#dashavatar #vishnu #lordvishnu #avatar #narasimha #krishna #shriram #parshuram #kalki #balarama #sanatandharma #hindumythology #indianmythology #harekrishna #rishikatha", "channel": "therishikatha", "uploader_id": "22569163881", "uploader": "Rishi Katha", "timestamp": 1793897987, "like_count": 54477, "comment_count": 202, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1155603143815707a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 49.163, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr2-3.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQNyrAbBWXL5SmkpClO44QUY4kEn4aFIDs0T21ngipURgzkfUE9S2xA2XqcvfRzUAlBKHBAKumlYH0CNIV57xk3yM148NNUPAAeiabQ.mp4?_nc_cat=111&_nc_oc=AdqPentRpARQ6oo8Tb9H2X3IXX1A0BrVEPV9Xyil8MVcigk_3rkiJypxJQJlTOibD0tMuTOFUWPaBB0WIZI66b60&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr2-3.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=5Y57gGtVgQ0Q7kNvwF_U6E4&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=7Loy4l-cp_oK7IRaAIFZZA&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQQ_C61egng5UAsRaLRiJZ34KfwRABgNw2oPVK2ZtUT9KA&oe=6AF4259C", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 49.163, "resolution": "audio only", "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/145.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "format": "dash-1155603143815707a - audio only (DASH audio)"}, {"url": "https://instagram.fblr22-1.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m86/AQNxcFy7lasVy4QX9iWlRXvFhs1UQiI0Pqck989rzlVrCUNTYwOCjAbZli_GB3KqYXtZgTYVgCSL1Lfm81GW3jcbck-RieMPr-SxqoY.mp4?_nc_cat=105&_nc_oc=AdogoOFIu5OVRb9-sxMnnXiT5FwNBZ1d6_OrbaZzU2kkHO69ngDJF_ZatTqp9stPGClmk2FqFC67Kg21h6IqUKn8&_nc_sid=5e9851&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr22-1.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=Gy3iSpJJyQEQ7kNvwHfvIVB&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6Inhwdl9wcm9ncmVzc2l2ZS5JTlNUQUdSQU0uQ0xJUFMuQzMuNzIwLmRhc2hfYmFzZWxpbmVfMV92MSIsInhwd